   "notes": "INFERENCE. The 2376 inverts data and strobe together (pin 20), so 'inverted data + positive strobe' needs one extra inverter: gate A (pins 1,2 -> 3) used as strobe inverter. Gate choice arbitrary. Gates B-D: role unknown (IC55 sits in the boxed CPU area round IC13 on the layout sheet, so it may serve the CPU figure); pins shown NC here only because nothing in this circuit needs them."
  },
